_08</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>National Institute of Justice</collab></person-group><source>ADAM preliminary 2000 findings on drug use &#x00026; drug markets</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Washington, DC: U.S. Department of Justice</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cartier</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Farabee</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Prendergast</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Methamphetamine use, self-reported violent crime, and recidivism among offenders in California who abuse substances</article-title><source>J Interpers Violence</source><year>2006</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>435</fpage><lpage>445</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16501213</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1177/0886260505285724</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kerr</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Wood</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Grafstein</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishida</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Shannon</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Lai</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Montaner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tyndall</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High rates of primary care and emergency department use among injection drug users in Vancouver</article-title><source>J Public Health (Oxf)</source><year>2005</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>62</fpage><lpage>66</lpage><comment>Epub 2004 Nov 25.</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15564279</pub-id><